# The repository stores LF. `core.autocrlf=true` on a Windows checkout hands
# the working tree CRLF, which Biome's formatter (LF, and not configurable per
# platform without breaking Linux CI) reports as a format error on every file —
# so `pnpm check` failed on a clean checkout with nothing wrong in the code.
# Pinning the working tree to LF makes the two agree everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary art: never touched.
*.avif binary
*.webp binary
*.png  binary
*.pdf  binary
